<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="page-banner">
  <div class="container">
    <h1><i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i> 人才培养</h1>
    <p>培养创新型频谱技术人才</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-content">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content-card" id="training">
      <div class="card-header">
        <h2><i class="fas fa-user-graduate"></i> 培养理念</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p>实验室秉承"厚基础、强实践、重创新"的人才培养理念，致力于培养具有扎实理论基础、较强实践能力和创新精神的高层次人才。</p>

        <div class="education-features">
          <div class="feature-item">
            <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-book"></i></div>
            <h3>理论学习</h3>
            <p>系统学习通信原理、信号处理、频谱分析等专业课程</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-item">
            <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-flask"></i></div>
            <h3>科研实践</h3>
            <p>参与实际科研项目，在实践中提升研究能力</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-item">
            <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-globe"></i></div>
            <h3>国际视野</h3>
            <p>鼓励参加国际学术会议，拓展国际学术视野</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-item">
            <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-trophy"></i></div>
            <h3>竞赛锻炼</h3>
            <p>组织参加各类学科竞赛，提升综合素质</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <h2><i class="fas fa-medal"></i> 培养成果</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="achievement-list">
          <div class="achievement-row">
            <div class="achievement-icon"><i class="fas fa-award"></i></div>
            <div class="achievement-text">
              <h4>优秀学位论文</h4>
              <p>多篇博士、硕士学位论文获得省级、校级优秀学位论文</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="achievement-row">
            <div class="achievement-icon"><i class="fas fa-star"></i></div>
            <div class="achievement-text">
              <h4>国家奖学金</h4>
              <p>多名研究生获得国家奖学金、校级奖学金</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="achievement-row">
            <div class="achievement-icon"><i class="fas fa-trophy"></i></div>
            <div class="achievement-text">
              <h4>学科竞赛</h4>
              <p>在全国研究生数学建模、电子设计竞赛等赛事中屡获佳绩</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="achievement-row">
            <div class="achievement-icon"><i class="fas fa-file-alt"></i></div>
            <div class="achievement-text">
              <h4>学术论文</h4>
              <p>研究生在读期间发表大量高水平学术论文</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <h2><i class="fas fa-newspaper"></i> 教学动态</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="news-detail-list">
          <% if (educationNews && educationNews.length > 0) { %>
            <% educationNews.forEach(function(news) { %>
              <div class="detail-item" data-cms-type="news" data-cms-id="<%= news.id %>">
                <div class="detail-date">
                  <span class="day"><%= news.publish_date.split('-')[2] %></span>
                  <span class="month"><%= news.publish_date.split('-')[0] %>-<%= news.publish_date.split('-')[1] %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-content">
                  <h4><a href="/news/<%= news.id %>"><%= news.title %></a></h4>
                  <p><%= news.summary %></p>
                </div>
              </div>
            <% }); %>
          <% } else { %>
            <p class="empty-text">暂无教学动态</p>
          <% } %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card" id="admissions">
      <div class="card-header">
        <h2><i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i> 招生信息</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="recruit-info">
          <p>实验室每年招收博士研究生和硕士研究生，欢迎具有通信工程、电子信息、信号处理等相关专业背景的同学报考。</p>
          <div class="recruit-details">
            <div class="recruit-item">
              <h4>博士招生</h4>
              <p>频谱认知与感知、天地一体化通信、智能信号处理等方向</p>
            </div>
            <div class="recruit-item">
              <h4>硕士招生</h4>
              <p>通信与信息系统、信号与信息处理等专业</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="contact-tip">有意者请将个人简历发送至：lab@nuaa.edu.cn</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
